WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.547 --> 00:00:02.299
Method of Completing Samayik.

00:00:02.692 --> 00:00:06.408
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu Javanijjae 
 Nisihiae,

00:00:06.408 --> 00:00:07.623
Matthaena Vandami.

00:00:07.782 --> 00:00:09.782
like this after Khamsaman

00:00:09.782 --> 00:00:10.988
like before

00:00:11.142 --> 00:00:14.263
receit Iriyavahiyam, Tassa Uttari, Annattha sutra

00:00:14.596 --> 00:00:16.376
chant 1 Logassa (untill Chandesu Nimmalayara)

00:00:16.376 --> 00:00:17.259
If you don't know,

00:00:17.259 --> 00:00:19.504
then chant four Navkar Mantras in Kausagg Mudra

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.409
then say Namo Arihantanam

00:00:24.682 --> 00:00:26.000
then recite Logassa

00:00:26.205 --> 00:00:27.881
Then, by giving a Khamasamana,

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:31.839
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:00:31.839 --> 00:00:32.988
Matthaena Vandami.

00:00:37.214 --> 00:00:39.558
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:00:39.558 --> 00:00:42.665
Samayik Muhapatti Padilehu? Ichcham.

00:00:42.665 --> 00:00:43.165
having said this,

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:45.319
recite Muhaptti ke 50 bol

00:00:57.158 --> 00:00:58.903
Then, by giving a Khamasamana,

00:00:58.903 --> 00:01:02.720
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:03.875
Matthaena Vandami.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:09.573
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:01:09.573 --> 00:01:11.768
Samayik Paru? Yathshakti

00:01:11.768 --> 00:01:13.768
Then, by giving a Kamasamana,

00:01:13.768 --> 00:01:17.584
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu 
 Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:01:17.584 --> 00:01:18.679
Matthaena Vandami.

00:01:23.571 --> 00:01:25.776
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:01:25.776 --> 00:01:27.617
Samayik Paryu? Tahati

00:01:27.617 --> 00:01:28.460
After saying this,

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:31.501
place your right hand on the 
 Charwala or Asan,

00:01:31.501 --> 00:01:33.120
bow your head,

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.687
and recite 1 Navkar Mantra 

00:01:34.687 --> 00:01:36.687
then recite Samaiya Vayajutto 

00:01:36.892 --> 00:01:39.322
Then, facing the Sthapnacharyaji,

00:01:39.322 --> 00:01:40.901
hold your right hand reversed

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.990
palm facing towards our face

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.324
recite 1 Navkar Mantra

